helpers.AppendTaskGuidance(lm, "Generate exactly one valid SMILES for an isocyanate molecule (R-N=C=O). Choose a structurally DIFFERENT compound each time. Examples by class — alkyl: O=C=NC (methyl), O=C=NCC (ethyl), O=C=NCCC (propyl), O=C=NCCCC (butyl), O=C=NCCCCC (pentyl); branched: O=C=NC(C)C (isopropyl), O=C=NC(C)(C)C (tert-butyl), O=C=NCC(C)C (isobutyl), O=C=NCC(C)(C)C (neopentyl); halogenated: O=C=NCF, O=C=NCCl, O=C=NCBr, O=C=NCC(F)(F)F, O=C=NCCCl, O=C=NCCF, O=C=NCCBr; cycloalkyl: O=C=NC1CC1 (cyclopropyl), O=C=NC1CCC1 (cyclobutyl), O=C=NC1CCCC1 (cyclopentyl), O=C=NC1CCCCC1 (cyclohexyl), O=C=NC1CCCCCC1 (cycloheptyl), O=C=NC1CCC(C)CC1 (4-methylcyclohexyl); aromatic: O=C=Nc1ccccc1 (phenyl), O=C=Nc1ccc(C)cc1 (4-tolyl), O=C=Nc1ccc(F)cc1 (4-fluorophenyl), O=C=Nc1ccc(Cl)cc1 (4-chlorophenyl), O=C=Nc1cccc(C)c1 (3-tolyl), O=C=Nc1ccc(OC)cc1 (4-methoxyphenyl); benzyl: O=C=NCc1ccccc1; heteroaromatic: O=C=Nc1ccccn1 (2-pyridyl), O=C=Nc1cccnc1 (3-pyridyl), O=C=Nc1ccncc1 (4-pyridyl), O=C=Nc1ccco1 (2-furyl); heterocyclic: O=C=NC1CCOCC1 (morpholinyl), O=C=NC1CCCCN1 (piperidinyl); unsaturated: O=C=NCC=C (allyl), O=C=NCC#C (propargyl), O=C=NC=C (vinyl); naphthyl: O=C=Nc1ccc2ccccc2c1; ether: O=C=NCCOC, O=C=NCCOCC. Output ONLY the SMILES string.");

